#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hdai_base.field_hdai_model__thinking_strength
msgid "Default reasoning strength for new conversations using this model. Sampling parameters (temperature / top P / top K) are configured by the administrator here as well and applied to every conversation. Users can still adjust reasoning per conversation when it is allowed."
msgstr "使用该模型的新对话默认推理强度。采样参数（temperature / Top P / Top K）也由管理员在此配置并应用于每个对话；允许推理时，用户仍可在单个对话中调整推理强度。"

